  "description": "EXTENSIONS AND ALTERATIONS TO THE EXISTING SINGLE STOREY DWELLINGHOUSE, IN ORDER TO INCREASE THE INTERNAL FLOORSPACE. THIS INCLUDES THE ERECTION OF AN ADDITIONAL STOREY AND THE ENLARGEMENT OF GROUND FLOOR LEVEL. ",
